    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>But that's just a nice way of saying it. In practice, no one is looking for a \"bridge.\" They just want the machine to do it faster and cheaper. I’m not a teacher or a guide, I’m just a guy who spent his life perfecting a craft that doesn't exist anymore. It feels less like I have a \"niche\" and more like I'm just a ghost in a world that's moved on. It's hard to find a reason to keep grinding through the days when everything you are has been rendered useless.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
